1
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:18,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:30,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:36,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:52,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:58,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:12,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:16,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 3]</font>

15
00:01:16,140 --> 00:01:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Court of Judicial Review]</font>

16
00:01:25,340 --> 00:01:27,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, Your Highness.</font>

17
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:29,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The suspect is filthy.</font>

18
00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:30,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not let her offend you.</font>

19
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:31,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get lost.</font>

20
00:01:33,220 --> 00:01:34,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This...</font>

21
00:01:34,980 --> 00:01:36,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In broad daylight,</font>

22
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">surely the Prince
wouldn't dare lay a hand on me.</font>

23
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:41,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eunuch Fuhai, please step aside.</font>

24
00:01:41,780 --> 00:01:42,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't make this hard for yourself.</font>

25
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:51,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you decided
what you'll say in a moment?</font>

26
00:01:52,020 --> 00:01:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The joint trial is full
of high ministers.</font>

27
00:01:55,420 --> 00:01:57,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will speak nothing but the truth.</font>

28
00:02:06,420 --> 00:02:06,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This...</font>

29
00:02:07,820 --> 00:02:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, it's poison!</font>

30
00:02:09,660 --> 00:02:10,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

31
00:02:10,980 --> 00:02:11,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Speak properly.</font>

32
00:02:12,980 --> 00:02:13,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I die,</font>

33
00:02:16,220 --> 00:02:17,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you won't live either.</font>

34
00:02:20,260 --> 00:02:21,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

35
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:22,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have no shame!</font>

36
00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Begin.</font>

37
00:02:39,860 --> 00:02:40,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan,</font>

38
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:42,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let me ask you:</font>

39
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:44,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you burn</font>

40
00:02:44,580 --> 00:02:46,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Xizhao Princess's body?</font>

41
00:02:47,540 --> 00:02:48,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

42
00:02:48,660 --> 00:02:50,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then who could it be?</font>

43
00:02:51,980 --> 00:02:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is...</font>

44
00:02:57,100 --> 00:02:58,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The killer is someone high above.</font>

45
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:00,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear if I speak,</font>

46
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:02,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">disaster will follow.</font>

47
00:03:02,700 --> 00:03:03,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just speak freely.</font>

48
00:03:04,540 --> 00:03:06,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one can harm you.</font>

49
00:03:09,460 --> 00:03:10,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually,</font>

50
00:03:10,660 --> 00:03:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the desecration of the corpse</font>

51
00:03:12,580 --> 00:03:14,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the sudden death
of the Xizhao Princess</font>

52
00:03:15,460 --> 00:03:16,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">share the same cause.</font>

53
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:19,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mean the same culprit?</font>

54
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:20,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That makes sense.</font>

55
00:03:22,020 --> 00:03:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only the killer would destroy
the body out of guilt.</font>

56
00:03:25,740 --> 00:03:26,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then tell us now:</font>

57
00:03:26,740 --> 00:03:28,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who burned</font>

58
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:29,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Princess's body?</font>

59
00:03:31,340 --> 00:03:32,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is...</font>

60
00:03:41,060 --> 00:03:41,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">heaven.</font>

61
00:03:45,220 --> 00:03:45,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nonsense!</font>

62
00:03:46,620 --> 00:03:47,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Excellency, please be patient.</font>

63
00:03:48,340 --> 00:03:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me show you something.</font>

64
00:03:56,260 --> 00:03:57,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is this?</font>

65
00:03:58,380 --> 00:03:59,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is this?</font>

66
00:04:04,620 --> 00:04:06,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the coffin
from the funeral procession</font>

67
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:08,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on Prince Duan's wedding day.</font>

68
00:04:09,660 --> 00:04:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The coffin was freshly painted.</font>

69
00:04:11,620 --> 00:04:12,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On Prince Duan's wedding day,</font>

70
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:14,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted</font>

71
00:04:14,180 --> 00:04:16,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to hide and sleep in this coffin</font>

72
00:04:16,700 --> 00:04:18,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and accidentally got paint on myself.</font>

73
00:04:19,940 --> 00:04:20,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even now,</font>

74
00:04:21,900 --> 00:04:23,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't managed to wash it off.</font>

75
00:04:28,820 --> 00:04:29,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Later,</font>

76
00:04:29,620 --> 00:04:31,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">an assassin hid inside the coffin</font>

77
00:04:31,340 --> 00:04:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and knocked me unconscious.</font>

78
00:04:33,260 --> 00:04:34,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On Prince Duan's wedding day,</font>

79
00:04:34,140 --> 00:04:37,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this assassin launched an attack,</font>

80
00:04:38,380 --> 00:04:40,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bursting out of the coffin
with me in tow.</font>

81
00:04:41,900 --> 00:04:42,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Their body</font>

82
00:04:43,460 --> 00:04:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must have traces of this paint on it.</font>

83
00:04:48,020 --> 00:04:49,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does that have to do</font>

84
00:04:49,540 --> 00:04:51,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the Princess's sudden death?</font>

85
00:04:52,180 --> 00:04:53,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You Beiyuan people</font>

86
00:04:53,580 --> 00:04:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be in collusion,</font>

87
00:04:54,900 --> 00:04:55,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">trying to shield the real killer.</font>

88
00:04:57,700 --> 00:04:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you so impatient?</font>

89
00:05:00,540 --> 00:05:02,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must investigate
the Xizhao Princess's murder,</font>

90
00:05:03,540 --> 00:05:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but does the attack on our Prince</font>

91
00:05:05,780 --> 00:05:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not require finding the true culprit?</font>

92
00:05:09,700 --> 00:05:10,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think you are the culprit.</font>

93
00:05:19,940 --> 00:05:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Beiyuan.</font>

94
00:05:21,740 --> 00:05:22,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who lives or dies here</font>

95
00:05:23,660 --> 00:05:24,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not for you to decide.</font>

96
00:05:24,860 --> 00:05:25,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You!</font>

97
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:27,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan's methods are brutal.</font>

98
00:05:27,820 --> 00:05:29,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not act rashly, Your Excellency.</font>

99
00:05:31,660 --> 00:05:32,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am here to observe the trial,</font>

100
00:05:33,540 --> 00:05:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not to listen to your squabbling.</font>

101
00:05:36,980 --> 00:05:37,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Continue the trial.</font>

102
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:41,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I shall present the final</font>

103
00:05:42,100 --> 00:05:43,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and most crucial evidence.</font>

104
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did assassins strike
on Prince Duan's wedding day?</font>

105
00:05:57,180 --> 00:05:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did the Princess die
in a foreign land?</font>

106
00:05:59,860 --> 00:06:00,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did the rose</font>

107
00:06:00,660 --> 00:06:03,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the Blissful Union Pot wither?</font>

108
00:06:05,380 --> 00:06:06,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually,</font>

109
00:06:08,140 --> 00:06:10,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it was all a sign from heaven.</font>

110
00:06:13,340 --> 00:06:15,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The flower is quite lovely.</font>

111
00:06:16,060 --> 00:06:17,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But this flowerpot</font>

112
00:06:18,220 --> 00:06:20,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">looks terribly tacky.</font>

113
00:06:21,620 --> 00:06:22,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you know?</font>

114
00:06:23,580 --> 00:06:24,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is called</font>

115
00:06:24,220 --> 00:06:25,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Blissful Union Pot.</font>

116
00:06:26,860 --> 00:06:27,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That fool.</font>

117
00:06:28,660 --> 00:06:30,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She still thinks
it's a Blissful Union Pot.</font>

118
00:06:31,820 --> 00:06:32,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

119
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:34,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have finally found you.</font>

120
00:06:36,220 --> 00:06:37,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well then, do enlighten us.</font>

121
00:06:37,780 --> 00:06:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What truly caused the Princess's death?</font>

122
00:06:41,780 --> 00:06:42,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This case</font>

123
00:06:43,020 --> 00:06:44,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was not the work of humans.</font>

124
00:06:44,860 --> 00:06:46,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was divine will from the heavens.</font>

125
00:06:48,020 --> 00:06:50,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Princess was the Rose Deity
beside the Queen Mother of the West.</font>

126
00:06:51,260 --> 00:06:52,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This withered rose was an omen</font>

127
00:06:53,580 --> 00:06:56,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before the Rose Deity's ascension.</font>

128
00:06:57,100 --> 00:06:58,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And the fire at the morgue</font>

129
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:00,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was simply because the Princess</font>

130
00:07:00,780 --> 00:07:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was a deity.</font>

131
00:07:02,820 --> 00:07:04,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She did not wish to leave</font>

132
00:07:04,740 --> 00:07:06,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">any trace behind in this mortal world.</font>

133
00:07:07,660 --> 00:07:08,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is utterly absurd.</font>

134
00:07:13,860 --> 00:07:15,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is everything
that happened in the case.</font>

135
00:07:16,860 --> 00:07:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Friends from Xizhao,</font>

136
00:07:19,060 --> 00:07:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">am I wrong?</font>

137
00:07:26,100 --> 00:07:26,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

138
00:07:27,700 --> 00:07:28,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our Princess</font>

139
00:07:29,540 --> 00:07:31,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a true fairy.</font>

140
00:07:32,100 --> 00:07:33,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her virtuous journey is now complete.</font>

141
00:07:33,860 --> 00:07:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She has returned to the heavenly realm.</font>

142
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:37,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

143
00:07:37,980 --> 00:07:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Honor.</font>

144
00:07:39,500 --> 00:07:41,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've fulfilled the mission.</font>

145
00:07:42,860 --> 00:07:43,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This case is closed.</font>

146
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:56,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The case is now closed.</font>

147
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:58,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan is acquitted of all charges.</font>

148
00:07:58,260 --> 00:07:58,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Court is adjourned.</font>

149
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:00,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, it's settled like that?</font>

150
00:08:17,340 --> 00:08:17,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

151
00:08:19,340 --> 00:08:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really outdid yourself.</font>

152
00:08:27,220 --> 00:08:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jinyu Chamber]
Take a look!</font>

153
00:08:28,140 --> 00:08:28,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's check it out up ahead.</font>

154
00:08:31,460 --> 00:08:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You performed admirably today.</font>

155
00:08:33,660 --> 00:08:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Up there in the court,</font>

156
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:37,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you left the Xizhao envoy speechless
with frustration.</font>

157
00:08:37,620 --> 00:08:38,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So effortlessly,</font>

158
00:08:38,540 --> 00:08:40,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you resolved a major crisis
between the two nations.</font>

159
00:08:40,940 --> 00:08:42,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you hadn't been checking
everyone's hands for paint stains</font>

160
00:08:42,860 --> 00:08:45,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at the Official Residence that day,</font>

161
00:08:45,460 --> 00:08:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could I have known</font>

162
00:08:47,260 --> 00:08:49,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the Xizhao envoy was the assassin?</font>

163
00:08:49,540 --> 00:08:51,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must thank you for the guidance.</font>

164
00:08:51,740 --> 00:08:53,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, that day, you used my name</font>

165
00:08:54,100 --> 00:08:55,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and delivered the supplies, didn't you?</font>

166
00:08:57,180 --> 00:08:58,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You needn't pretend.</font>

167
00:08:58,940 --> 00:09:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you hadn't known it was me,</font>

168
00:09:00,780 --> 00:09:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why would you have chosen me
as the scapegoat?</font>

169
00:09:03,300 --> 00:09:04,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Xizhao Princess</font>

170
00:09:04,260 --> 00:09:06,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has long harbored resentment
toward Beiyuan and me.</font>

171
00:09:06,540 --> 00:09:07,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she remained in Beiyuan,</font>

172
00:09:08,260 --> 00:09:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she would bring ruin
to the imperial court.</font>

173
00:09:09,660 --> 00:09:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I merely wished for Xizhao
to reap what it sowed.</font>

174
00:09:12,380 --> 00:09:13,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What I did not expect</font>

175
00:09:13,980 --> 00:09:15,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was that you would rush out</font>

176
00:09:15,620 --> 00:09:16,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and ruin my plan.</font>

177
00:09:16,620 --> 00:09:17,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You needn't explain yourself to me.</font>

178
00:09:18,820 --> 00:09:19,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me the antidote.</font>

179
00:09:32,660 --> 00:09:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

180
00:09:35,380 --> 00:09:36,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have prepared wine and food.</font>

181
00:09:37,580 --> 00:09:38,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay and eat before you go.</font>

182
00:09:40,700 --> 00:09:41,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My elderly mother at home</font>

183
00:09:41,780 --> 00:09:43,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is waiting for me to return safely.</font>

184
00:09:46,580 --> 00:09:47,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just keep me company for a while.</font>

185
00:09:49,340 --> 00:09:51,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You tried to kill me before the trial.</font>

186
00:09:52,060 --> 00:09:53,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Putting on this act</font>

187
00:09:54,220 --> 00:09:55,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">only reminds me of everything</font>

188
00:09:55,380 --> 00:09:57,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you did to me in prison.</font>

189
00:09:58,660 --> 00:09:59,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It disgusts me.</font>

190
00:10:15,860 --> 00:10:16,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

191
00:10:18,300 --> 00:10:19,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you certain she is Qin Wei?</font>

192
00:10:21,700 --> 00:10:23,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She only wants to be free of you</font>

193
00:10:23,060 --> 00:10:24,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to live a carefree life.</font>

194
00:10:25,060 --> 00:10:27,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why cling to someone like her?</font>

195
00:10:27,780 --> 00:10:28,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut up.</font>

196
00:10:28,940 --> 00:10:29,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you forgotten</font>

197
00:10:30,820 --> 00:10:32,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who brought the General's Mansion</font>

198
00:10:32,020 --> 00:10:33,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to such ruin?</font>

199
00:10:42,220 --> 00:10:43,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

200
00:10:44,020 --> 00:10:44,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I despise you.</font>

201
00:10:45,780 --> 00:10:47,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will never forget
my parents' brutal death.</font>

202
00:10:47,780 --> 00:10:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My brother's whereabouts
remain unknown.</font>

203
00:10:49,100 --> 00:10:50,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's all because of you.</font>

204
00:10:51,620 --> 00:10:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just you wait.</font>

205
00:10:54,300 --> 00:10:56,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Yizhuang]</font>

206
00:10:56,260 --> 00:10:56,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

207
00:10:56,780 --> 00:10:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

208
00:10:57,740 --> 00:10:59,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To celebrate Qinglan</font>

209
00:10:59,060 --> 00:11:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">cheating death. Cheers!</font>

210
00:11:00,700 --> 00:11:01,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Cheers.
- Cheers!</font>

211
00:11:04,700 --> 00:11:05,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

212
00:11:05,620 --> 00:11:07,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must properly thank Mr. Jiang.</font>

213
00:11:07,460 --> 00:11:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So many times,</font>

214
00:11:08,260 --> 00:11:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he has been the one to shield you.</font>

215
00:11:10,140 --> 00:11:11,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have another drink with Mr. Jiang.</font>

216
00:11:12,260 --> 00:11:13,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Jun,</font>

217
00:11:13,380 --> 00:11:15,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this actually has little to do
with Jiang Yufan.</font>

218
00:11:15,980 --> 00:11:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wasn't of much use.</font>

219
00:11:17,540 --> 00:11:19,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was mainly our Jun's own cleverness</font>

220
00:11:19,860 --> 00:11:21,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that allowed her to navigate all sides</font>

221
00:11:21,020 --> 00:11:22,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and clear herself of suspicion.</font>

222
00:11:22,580 --> 00:11:23,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

223
00:11:23,980 --> 00:11:25,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even I didn't believe your tall tales,</font>

224
00:11:26,020 --> 00:11:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet no one
in the imperial court objected.</font>

225
00:11:28,020 --> 00:11:29,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are they all fools?</font>

226
00:11:29,620 --> 00:11:30,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because that Xizhao envoy</font>

227
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the assassin on the wedding day.</font>

228
00:11:33,580 --> 00:11:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Princess died.</font>

229
00:11:35,260 --> 00:11:37,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I had identified him
at the joint trial,</font>

230
00:11:38,060 --> 00:11:39,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you think he would have lived?</font>

231
00:11:40,180 --> 00:11:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He fears death.</font>

232
00:11:41,940 --> 00:11:43,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But will Xizhao accept this?</font>

233
00:11:44,180 --> 00:11:45,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since he admitted all that,</font>

234
00:11:46,140 --> 00:11:47,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there will be a way to handle it.</font>

235
00:11:49,540 --> 00:11:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who really killed</font>

236
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Xizhao Princess?</font>

237
00:11:53,500 --> 00:11:54,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The true culprit is...</font>

238
00:12:02,020 --> 00:12:02,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know either.</font>

239
00:12:03,780 --> 00:12:05,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you just leaving us hanging?</font>

240
00:12:06,060 --> 00:12:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The more we know,
the greater the danger.</font>

241
00:12:08,420 --> 00:12:09,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If Qinglan doesn't know about it,
she'll be safe.</font>

242
00:12:10,340 --> 00:12:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that perfect?</font>

243
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:12,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">True, true.</font>

244
00:12:12,900 --> 00:12:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That does make sense.</font>

245
00:12:14,780 --> 00:12:16,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But offending Princess Changle...</font>

246
00:12:17,500 --> 00:12:18,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The loss outweighs the gain.</font>

247
00:12:18,780 --> 00:12:20,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is Jun Qinglan here?</font>

248
00:12:32,260 --> 00:12:32,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eunuch.</font>

249
00:12:32,580 --> 00:12:33,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eunuch Li.</font>

250
00:12:33,620 --> 00:12:34,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An oral decree from His Majesty:</font>

251
00:12:34,940 --> 00:12:36,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan has served well in the case.</font>

252
00:12:36,860 --> 00:12:39,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow at the Si hour,
come to the Imperial Palace</font>

253
00:12:39,860 --> 00:12:41,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and receive your imperial reward.</font>

254
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:42,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A reward?</font>

255
00:12:44,300 --> 00:12:44,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wonderful.</font>

256
00:12:45,740 --> 00:12:46,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Eunuch.</font>

257
00:12:56,220 --> 00:12:57,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Stop!
- Stop!</font>

258
00:12:57,460 --> 00:12:58,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Don't run!
- Stop!</font>

259
00:12:59,060 --> 00:13:00,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Stop!
- Stop right there!</font>

260
00:13:01,380 --> 00:13:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- After him!
- Don't run!</font>

261
00:13:02,860 --> 00:13:04,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Hurry!
- Stop!</font>

262
00:13:04,500 --> 00:13:05,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Stop!
- Stop!</font>

263
00:13:06,380 --> 00:13:07,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't run!</font>

264
00:13:09,460 --> 00:13:10,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Stop!
- Don't run!</font>

265
00:13:14,780 --> 00:13:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, what's wrong?</font>

266
00:13:17,220 --> 00:13:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

267
00:13:23,260 --> 00:13:25,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You dreamed of the cliff again?</font>

268
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:27,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother.</font>

269
00:13:28,060 --> 00:13:28,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

270
00:13:29,420 --> 00:13:30,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've worried you again.</font>

271
00:13:31,860 --> 00:13:33,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must owe you from a past life.</font>

272
00:13:34,380 --> 00:13:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it true</font>

273
00:13:35,940 --> 00:13:37,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you don't remember the past?</font>

274
00:13:40,420 --> 00:13:41,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't remember.</font>

275
00:13:43,940 --> 00:13:44,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps it's best forgotten.</font>

276
00:13:45,500 --> 00:13:46,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you've forgotten it,</font>

277
00:13:46,500 --> 00:13:47,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">start anew.</font>

278
00:13:52,460 --> 00:13:53,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother.</font>

279
00:13:54,420 --> 00:13:55,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If not for you,</font>

280
00:13:55,980 --> 00:13:57,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would have died
at the bottom of that cliff.</font>

281
00:13:59,500 --> 00:14:00,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

282
00:14:03,420 --> 00:14:05,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Heaven has taken pity on me</font>

283
00:14:05,540 --> 00:14:08,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and sent you to my side
to keep me company.</font>

284
00:14:08,500 --> 00:14:09,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise,</font>

285
00:14:09,540 --> 00:14:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could an old widow like me</font>

286
00:14:11,180 --> 00:14:13,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ever bear the pain of losing my son?</font>

287
00:14:15,580 --> 00:14:16,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother.</font>

288
00:14:17,020 --> 00:14:17,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,</font>

289
00:14:17,900 --> 00:14:19,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will be your son.</font>

290
00:14:19,420 --> 00:14:20,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For all my life.</font>

291
00:14:20,620 --> 00:14:21,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, you silly girl.</font>

292
00:14:21,900 --> 00:14:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have what it takes?</font>

293
00:14:24,580 --> 00:14:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What you need to do most urgently</font>

294
00:14:25,660 --> 00:14:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is find yourself a good husband</font>

295
00:14:27,660 --> 00:14:28,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and give me a chubby grandson.</font>

296
00:14:29,180 --> 00:14:30,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then for the rest of my life,</font>

297
00:14:30,220 --> 00:14:31,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would have nothing left
to worry about.</font>

298
00:14:32,820 --> 00:14:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think Mr. Jiang is quite a fine man.</font>

299
00:14:37,300 --> 00:14:38,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, you child.</font>

300
00:14:38,220 --> 00:14:38,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every time</font>

301
00:14:39,060 --> 00:14:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this comes up, you lie down.</font>

302
00:14:40,980 --> 00:14:42,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quick, get up!</font>

303
00:14:43,460 --> 00:14:43,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings,</font>

304
00:14:44,140 --> 00:14:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty.</font>

305
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Jun Qinglan.</font>

306
00:14:47,220 --> 00:14:48,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, Your Majesty.</font>

307
00:14:48,660 --> 00:14:49,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two</font>

308
00:14:49,580 --> 00:14:51,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">did very well in the Xizhao case.</font>

309
00:14:51,660 --> 00:14:52,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may rise.</font>

310
00:14:53,220 --> 00:14:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Your Majesty.</font>

311
00:14:55,100 --> 00:14:55,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan,</font>

312
00:14:56,340 --> 00:14:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this case involved diplomatic relations
between the two nations.</font>

313
00:14:58,340 --> 00:14:59,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As a coroner,</font>

314
00:14:59,940 --> 00:15:01,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you still dared to shoulder
such a heavy burden.</font>

315
00:15:01,620 --> 00:15:02,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your courage is truly commendable.</font>

316
00:15:04,300 --> 00:15:05,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many thanks for your praise.</font>

317
00:15:05,900 --> 00:15:06,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me.</font>

318
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What reward do you desire?</font>

319
00:15:10,700 --> 00:15:11,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

320
00:15:11,900 --> 00:15:12,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have long held</font>

321
00:15:12,780 --> 00:15:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a wish</font>

322
00:15:14,140 --> 00:15:15,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and hoped to ask for your help.</font>

323
00:15:16,220 --> 00:15:16,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

324
00:15:17,300 --> 00:15:18,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feared that speaking it aloud</font>

325
00:15:18,700 --> 00:15:19,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">might incur your displeasure.</font>

326
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:21,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Speak freely.</font>

327
00:15:21,580 --> 00:15:22,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I shall not punish you.</font>

328
00:15:24,460 --> 00:15:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">During this investigation,</font>

329
00:15:26,300 --> 00:15:27,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I owe much to Prince Duan</font>

330
00:15:27,940 --> 00:15:29,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Princess Changle for their guidance.</font>

331
00:15:30,100 --> 00:15:31,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Princess Changle, in particular,</font>

332
00:15:31,260 --> 00:15:32,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">offered me invaluable advice.</font>

333
00:15:33,340 --> 00:15:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She made me</font>

334
00:15:34,300 --> 00:15:35,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">see things with sudden clarity,</font>

335
00:15:35,540 --> 00:15:36,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I have benefited greatly.</font>

336
00:15:37,420 --> 00:15:39,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Compared to her sharp insight,</font>

337
00:15:39,860 --> 00:15:40,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel</font>

338
00:15:40,820 --> 00:15:42,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">deeply ashamed of my inadequacy.</font>

339
00:15:42,620 --> 00:15:43,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Therefore,</font>

340
00:15:44,060 --> 00:15:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg you to grant me permission...</font>

341
00:15:45,700 --> 00:15:46,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

342
00:15:47,740 --> 00:15:48,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wish to request</font>

343
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:50,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a marriage decree.</font>

344
00:15:51,100 --> 00:15:51,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A marriage decree?</font>

345
00:15:53,380 --> 00:15:54,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">State your case, then.</font>

346
00:15:55,620 --> 00:15:56,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have fallen deeply in love</font>

347
00:15:56,700 --> 00:15:57,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at first sight with Jun Qinglan.</font>

348
00:15:58,940 --> 00:16:00,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg your gracious consent</font>

349
00:16:00,020 --> 00:16:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to bestow Jun Qinglan upon me.</font>

350
00:16:02,860 --> 00:16:03,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Outrageous!</font>

351
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:05,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Xizhao Princess is
barely cold in her grave,</font>

352
00:16:06,060 --> 00:16:06,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you...</font>

353
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:08,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare you ask me for a marriage?</font>

354
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:10,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

355
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:12,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

356
00:16:13,230 --> 00:16:16,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

357
00:16:17,150 --> 00:16:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

358
00:16:21,700 --> 00:16:24,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

359
00:16:25,680 --> 00:16:29,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

360
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:34,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

361
00:16:34,540 --> 00:16:40,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

362
00:16:42,670 --> 00:16:46,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

363
00:16:47,340 --> 00:16:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

364
00:16:51,390 --> 00:16:55,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

365
00:16:55,940 --> 00:16:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

366
00:16:59,910 --> 00:17:04,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

367
00:17:04,520 --> 00:17:08,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
